WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.612
Lab 2 moves to a test tenant and a
test subscription, never production.

2
00:00:04.612 --> 00:00:06.929
You give a reader app nothing but Reader,

3
00:00:06.929 --> 00:00:11.141
write a small desired state with one
hand-made standing Owner to convert,

4
00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:15.424
and plan live, comparing what the code
read with what the admin center shows.

5
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:18.691
Then you grant the write role
for a single day, apply,

6
00:00:18.691 --> 00:00:22.113
and activate as the test user
to see the approval flow.

7
00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:26.801
There's also a small experiment to settle
an open question about the narrower role.

8
00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.468
And to back it out, wait
five minutes first:

9
00:00:29.468 --> 00:00:32.830
Learn says a new assignment
can't be removed sooner.
